# No IDE browser

**Hard rule: do not open, navigate, snapshot, screenshot, or otherwise use the in-IDE browser.**

- Do **not** call `cursor-ide-browser` tools (`browser_navigate`, `browser_snapshot`, `browser_take_screenshot`, `browser_lock`, `browser_click`, CDP, etc.).
- Do **not** open Simple Browser, preview panes, or any automated browser tab to “verify” UI.
- The user looks at the app themselves. Your job ends at code/changes; stop there.
- If visual check seems needed, say what to look at (URL/path, what changed) in one short note — then stop. Do not open a browser.
